[[:db/add "d54b6829-c036-5c86-b2c1-d6fd61c6ff36" :answer/id #uuid "d54b6829-c036-5c86-b2c1-d6fd61c6ff36"] [:db/add "d54b6829-c036-5c86-b2c1-d6fd61c6ff36" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d54b6829-c036-5c86-b2c1-d6fd61c6ff36" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4y-4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "d54b6829-c036-5c86-b2c1-d6fd61c6ff36" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1c9e038f-798b-5a50-a53e-3143e0ada903" :answer/id #uuid "1c9e038f-798b-5a50-a53e-3143e0ada903"] [:db/add "1c9e038f-798b-5a50-a53e-3143e0ada903" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1c9e038f-798b-5a50-a53e-3143e0ada903" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2y-8 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "1c9e038f-798b-5a50-a53e-3143e0ada903" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2717fde2-8f1c-5a54-b38d-87a66030d2a1" :answer/id #uuid "2717fde2-8f1c-5a54-b38d-87a66030d2a1"] [:db/add "2717fde2-8f1c-5a54-b38d-87a66030d2a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2717fde2-8f1c-5a54-b38d-87a66030d2a1" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2y-8 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "2717fde2-8f1c-5a54-b38d-87a66030d2a1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e" :answer/id #uuid "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e"] [:db/add "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e" :answer/value "No solution"] [:db/ensure "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "31f04780-6e99-5408-8c6e-46be312ca9ca" :answer/id #uuid "31f04780-6e99-5408-8c6e-46be312ca9ca"] [:db/add "31f04780-6e99-5408-8c6e-46be312ca9ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "31f04780-6e99-5408-8c6e-46be312ca9ca" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4y-4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "31f04780-6e99-5408-8c6e-46be312ca9ca" :answer/validate] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/id #uuid "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e"] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/choices "d54b6829-c036-5c86-b2c1-d6fd61c6ff36"] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/choices "1c9e038f-798b-5a50-a53e-3143e0ada903"] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/choices "2717fde2-8f1c-5a54-b38d-87a66030d2a1"] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/choices "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e"] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/choices "31f04780-6e99-5408-8c6e-46be312ca9ca"] [:db/add "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/correct "fde72c0c-5161-5b54-9d90-7d235457bc1e"] [:db/ensure "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4" :question/id #uuid "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4"] [:db/add "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=-8 \\\\ -3x+6y &=30.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system."] [:db/add "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -8 \\\\ -3 & 6 & 30\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -8 \\\\ -3 & 6 & 30\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=-8 \\\\ 0x+0y &=6.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0x+0y=6$ has no solution. It simplifies to $0=6,$ which is a false statement.\n\nSo, there is no pair $x,y$ that satisfies both equations in the system. Consequently, the overall system has no solution."] [:db/add "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4" :question/answer-fields "562e43a0-eb15-5412-82fb-b582a3b8030e"] [:db/ensure "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105746 :knowledge-point/questions "f9804fd7-a10f-5caf-8c5a-c0db8ce3b0c4"] [:db/add "7c93863d-037b-5e82-8551-c38f3f53a198" :answer/id #uuid "7c93863d-037b-5e82-8551-c38f3f53a198"] [:db/add "7c93863d-037b-5e82-8551-c38f3f53a198" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7c93863d-037b-5e82-8551-c38f3f53a198" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3y-4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "7c93863d-037b-5e82-8551-c38f3f53a198" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bf4109ee-8abb-55ff-a747-7f28815c182e" :answer/id #uuid "bf4109ee-8abb-55ff-a747-7f28815c182e"] [:db/add "bf4109ee-8abb-55ff-a747-7f28815c182e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bf4109ee-8abb-55ff-a747-7f28815c182e" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y+4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "bf4109ee-8abb-55ff-a747-7f28815c182e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f9d5b93f-f29a-5b25-bd0d-88e50c25bacd" :answer/id #uuid "f9d5b93f-f29a-5b25-bd0d-88e50c25bacd"] [:db/add "f9d5b93f-f29a-5b25-bd0d-88e50c25bacd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f9d5b93f-f29a-5b25-bd0d-88e50c25bacd" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y-4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "f9d5b93f-f29a-5b25-bd0d-88e50c25bacd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4111ae81-ed06-5e3c-85dc-59490a0f38c2" :answer/id #uuid "4111ae81-ed06-5e3c-85dc-59490a0f38c2"] [:db/add "4111ae81-ed06-5e3c-85dc-59490a0f38c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4111ae81-ed06-5e3c-85dc-59490a0f38c2" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}4-3y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "4111ae81-ed06-5e3c-85dc-59490a0f38c2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1d05d4a5-9123-5a5e-8c0b-302707936563" :answer/id #uuid "1d05d4a5-9123-5a5e-8c0b-302707936563"] [:db/add "1d05d4a5-9123-5a5e-8c0b-302707936563" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "1d05d4a5-9123-5a5e-8c0b-302707936563" :answer/value "No solution"] [:db/ensure "1d05d4a5-9123-5a5e-8c0b-302707936563" :answer/validate] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/id #uuid "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87"] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/choices "7c93863d-037b-5e82-8551-c38f3f53a198"] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/choices "bf4109ee-8abb-55ff-a747-7f28815c182e"] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/choices "f9d5b93f-f29a-5b25-bd0d-88e50c25bacd"] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/choices "4111ae81-ed06-5e3c-85dc-59490a0f38c2"] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/choices "1d05d4a5-9123-5a5e-8c0b-302707936563"] [:db/add "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/correct "f9d5b93f-f29a-5b25-bd0d-88e50c25bacd"] [:db/ensure "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921" :question/id #uuid "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921"] [:db/add "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=-4 \\\\ -12x+36y &=48.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system."] [:db/add "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -4 \\\\ -12 & 36 & 48\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -4 \\\\ -12 & 36 & 48\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+12{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -3 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y &=-4 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx-3y=-4.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=3y-4,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=3y-4 \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y-4 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$"] [:db/add "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921" :question/answer-fields "323634c4-8152-5ed5-a4bd-741f7b365c87"] [:db/ensure "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105746 :knowledge-point/questions "0075a5c6-0e03-5984-8b49-105838330921"] [:db/add "2d169cee-a67b-5603-8e29-2f8829f04404" :answer/id #uuid "2d169cee-a67b-5603-8e29-2f8829f04404"] [:db/add "2d169cee-a67b-5603-8e29-2f8829f04404" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2d169cee-a67b-5603-8e29-2f8829f04404" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6-3y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "2d169cee-a67b-5603-8e29-2f8829f04404" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2" :answer/id #uuid "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2"] [:db/add "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2" :answer/value "No solution"] [:db/ensure "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0ed15d24-b898-586a-a1a1-7e7e533a2f67" :answer/id #uuid "0ed15d24-b898-586a-a1a1-7e7e533a2f67"] [:db/add "0ed15d24-b898-586a-a1a1-7e7e533a2f67" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0ed15d24-b898-586a-a1a1-7e7e533a2f67" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y+6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "0ed15d24-b898-586a-a1a1-7e7e533a2f67" :answer/validate] [:db/add "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be" :answer/id #uuid "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be"] [:db/add "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3y-6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6c2f60bc-0c6b-5edf-9272-57f37aaea64a" :answer/id #uuid "6c2f60bc-0c6b-5edf-9272-57f37aaea64a"] [:db/add "6c2f60bc-0c6b-5edf-9272-57f37aaea64a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6c2f60bc-0c6b-5edf-9272-57f37aaea64a" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3y-6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "6c2f60bc-0c6b-5edf-9272-57f37aaea64a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/id #uuid "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4"] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/choices "2d169cee-a67b-5603-8e29-2f8829f04404"] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/choices "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2"] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/choices "0ed15d24-b898-586a-a1a1-7e7e533a2f67"] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/choices "39e0e04c-93f9-54b5-a484-f2d9a60598be"] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/choices "6c2f60bc-0c6b-5edf-9272-57f37aaea64a"] [:db/add "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/correct "f704f18e-d06d-5324-965f-8b94ff5810d2"] [:db/ensure "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b" :question/id #uuid "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b"] [:db/add "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y &=-6 \\\\ 2x+6y &=-7.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system."] [:db/add "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -7\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 2 & 6 & -7\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 3 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+3y &=-6 \\\\ 0x+0y &=5.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nHowever, the final equation $0x+0y=5$ has no solution. It simplifies to $0=5,$ which is a false statement.\n\nSo, there is no pair $x,y$ that satisfies both equations in the system. Consequently, the overall system has no solution."] [:db/add "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b" :question/answer-fields "82fef62f-2021-5195-b1a6-5b8d877c6dd4"] [:db/ensure "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105746 :knowledge-point/questions "f3181108-6901-544f-bc34-d0fa3617da7b"] [:db/add "f3c673c5-f4c0-5d0d-bb51-b280f48a19e2" :answer/id #uuid "f3c673c5-f4c0-5d0d-bb51-b280f48a19e2"] [:db/add "f3c673c5-f4c0-5d0d-bb51-b280f48a19e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f3c673c5-f4c0-5d0d-bb51-b280f48a19e2" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2y+6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "f3c673c5-f4c0-5d0d-bb51-b280f48a19e2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b7848208-b871-5a17-84b1-3b9c6807c229" :answer/id #uuid "b7848208-b871-5a17-84b1-3b9c6807c229"] [:db/add "b7848208-b871-5a17-84b1-3b9c6807c229" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "b7848208-b871-5a17-84b1-3b9c6807c229" :answer/value "No solution"] [:db/ensure "b7848208-b871-5a17-84b1-3b9c6807c229" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cd5338fa-f2d5-5f21-9ced-a4cbb650a386" :answer/id #uuid "cd5338fa-f2d5-5f21-9ced-a4cbb650a386"] [:db/add "cd5338fa-f2d5-5f21-9ced-a4cbb650a386" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cd5338fa-f2d5-5f21-9ced-a4cbb650a386" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-y-12 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "cd5338fa-f2d5-5f21-9ced-a4cbb650a386" :answer/validate] [:db/add "32919808-37f3-50f9-84d3-fbc5f4e790be" :answer/id #uuid "32919808-37f3-50f9-84d3-fbc5f4e790be"] [:db/add "32919808-37f3-50f9-84d3-fbc5f4e790be" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "32919808-37f3-50f9-84d3-fbc5f4e790be" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}6-2y \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "32919808-37f3-50f9-84d3-fbc5f4e790be" :answer/validate] [:db/add "34af56ad-6e01-5418-9bbd-444996023af2" :answer/id #uuid "34af56ad-6e01-5418-9bbd-444996023af2"] [:db/add "34af56ad-6e01-5418-9bbd-444996023af2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "34af56ad-6e01-5418-9bbd-444996023af2" :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2y-6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "34af56ad-6e01-5418-9bbd-444996023af2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/id #uuid "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af"] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/choices "f3c673c5-f4c0-5d0d-bb51-b280f48a19e2"] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/choices "b7848208-b871-5a17-84b1-3b9c6807c229"] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/choices "cd5338fa-f2d5-5f21-9ced-a4cbb650a386"] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/choices "32919808-37f3-50f9-84d3-fbc5f4e790be"] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/choices "34af56ad-6e01-5418-9bbd-444996023af2"] [:db/add "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/correct "f3c673c5-f4c0-5d0d-bb51-b280f48a19e2"] [:db/ensure "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276" :question/id #uuid "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276"] [:db/add "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=6 \\\\ -4x+8y &=-24.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system."] [:db/add "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 6 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -24\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 6 \\\\ -4 & 8 & -24\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & -2 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y &=6 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx-2y=6.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=2y+6,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=2y+6 \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2y+6 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$"] [:db/add "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276" :question/answer-fields "95db082d-c26f-5c7b-b38f-fad722cb20af"] [:db/ensure "d57ed010-daa6-567c-bb10-67266ffc6276" :question/validate] [:db/add 175