=\\begin{bmatrix}7y-2 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/ensure "00bae4f2-c744-5e19-959a-6de560d03eda" :answer/validate] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/id #uuid "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e"] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/choices "8aee1d92-25cf-5833-b645-e7aa415b5d15"] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/choices "34c7e84b-f840-570a-bcc7-3dc041afa01e"] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/choices "729751a0-35e8-5f03-9e69-86c3ba528575"] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/choices "82f6a6a5-6ae2-521b-922f-c15522a89001"] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/choices "00bae4f2-c744-5e19-959a-6de560d03eda"] [:db/add "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/correct "82f6a6a5-6ae2-521b-922f-c15522a89001"] [:db/ensure "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39" :question/id #uuid "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39"] [:db/add "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+7y &=-2 \\\\ 6x+42y &=-12.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system."] [:db/add "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39" :question/worked-solution "First, we set up the augmented matrix for the system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 42 & -12\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to row echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 6 & 42 & -12\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-6{R}_{1} \\\\  & \\sim\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}1 & 7 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+7y &=-2 \\\\ 0x+0y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nSince any pair of numbers $x,y$ is a solution of the final equation $0x+0y=0,$ we can remove this equation from the system. So, our system now consists of a single equation\n\n$$\nx+7y=-2.\n$$\n\nThe first variable $(x)$ is the basic variable, and the second variable $(y)$ is the free variable. Solving for the basic variable $(x)$ in terms of the free variable $(y),$ we get $x=-7y-2,$ and the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x &=-7y-2 \\\\ y &=y\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nwhere $y$ is an arbitrary number.\n\nIn vector form, the general solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}x \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-7y-2 \\\\ y\\end{bmatrix},\\,y\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$"] [:db/add "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39" :question/answer-fields "29cf15d2-2011-5f4e-80af-af23c260159e"] [:db/ensure "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186105746 :knowledge-point/questions "3931dc59-4686-5bc2-ac4e-2960e7037f39"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/id #uuid "dd2c4e37-ba04-5204-83a3-3f1f7d6cd44f"] [:db/add "generator" :question-generator/script "generators/db/db43ac6dd78fb2437438752aca11360188be865dbab39ed792cbce1b597019d7/17592186105746.py"] [:db/add 17592186105746 :knowledge-point/question-generator "generator"] [:db/ensure 17592186105746 :knowledge-point/validate]]
